issible\">مُو</span>نَ","سَلْهُمْ أَيُّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa_shafawi\">هُم بِ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ذَٰ</span>لِكَ زَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">عِي</span>مٌ","أَمْ لَهُمْ شُرَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">كَآ</span>ءُ فَلْيَأْتُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> بِشُرَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">كَآ</span>ئِهِمْ إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن كَ</span>انُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">صَٰ</span>دِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">قِي</span>نَ","يَوْمَ يُكْشَفُ عَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن سَ</span>ا<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">قٍ وَ</span>يُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>عَوْنَ إِلَى <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سُّجُودِ فَلَا يَسْتَطِي<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">عُو</span>نَ","<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">خَٰ</span>شِعَةً أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">صَٰ</span>رُهُمْ تَرْهَقُهُمْ ذِلَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">ةٌ‌ۖ وَ</span>قَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span> كَانُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> يُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>عَوْنَ إِلَى <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سُّجُودِ وَهُمْ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">سَٰ</span>لِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">مُو</span>نَ","فَذَرْنِى وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">مَن يُ</span>كَذِّبُ بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">هَٰ</span>ذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَدِيثِ‌ۖ سَنَسْتَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>رِجُ<span class=\"tajweed tajw